{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And Elohim remembered Abraham.</b> What is the remembrance of Abraham for Lot's sake? He remembered that Lot knew that Sarah was Abraham's wife, and he heard Abraham say in Egypt, 'She is my sister,' and he did not reveal the matter — for he was solicitous of him. Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, was solicitous of him (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:31.507502738Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}